sm leading-relaxed text-white/55">Secure parking and safe commuting for the workforce that travels daily.</span></figcaption></figure></div></div><div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-10 gap-y-8 border-t border-white/10 pt-14 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><span class="h-[2px] w-8 bg-primary"></span><h3 class="font-serif text-base font-bold text-foreground">Our People</h3><p class="font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/50">Teamwork, respect, and inclusion — every employee valued and heard.</p></div></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><span class="h-[2px] w-8 bg-primary"></span><h3 class="font-serif text-base font-bold text-foreground">Rewards &amp; Recognition</h3><p class="font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/50">Competitive pay, advancement, and recognition for dedication.</p></div></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><span class="h-[2px] w-8 bg-primary"></span><h3 class="font-serif text-base font-bold text-foreground">Wellbeing &amp; Safety</h3><p class="font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/50">Human rights protected in a safe, healthy, respectful workplace.</p></div></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><span class="h-[2px] w-8 bg-primary"></span><h3 class="font-serif text-base font-bold text-foreground">Learning &amp; Growth</h3><p class="font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/50">Structured training and leadership development for every career.</p></div></div></div><div class="mt-16 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><a class="group flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full border-2 border-primary/50 bg-transparent px-7 py-3.5 font-sans text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white transition-all duration-300 